        <mxCell id="ember-desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;align=left;fontColor=#BF360C;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=3;" value="&lt;b&gt;AI Assistant Observability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Normalized telemetry for AI tool usage.&lt;br&gt;Version-aware metrics. Privacy-first.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; AgentMetricEvent schema&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; Skill activation + cost tracking&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; Version enrichment via Forge&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; Push to company&amp;rsquo;s own backend&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(DataDog, Grafana, OTLP, webhook)&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; Crucible never sees the data&lt;br&gt;&amp;#9679; Closed loop: measure → optimize" vertex="1">
